  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse the Pythagorean theorem to calculate the length of the hypotenuse of a right triangle with legs of length 4 and 5 units. Use the GEOBOARD application to verify your result.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
