      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe Pythagorean Theorem states that the hypotenuse of a right triangle with legs of length \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e and \u003ci\u003eb\u003c/i\u003e units is\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"65\" height\u003d\"27\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_8_1_realnumbersandthepythagoreantheorem_4_70/image028.gif\" class\u003d\"text-top\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSubstitute \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 4 and \u003ci\u003eb\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 5.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"136\" height\u003d\"27\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_8_1_realnumbersandthepythagoreantheorem_4_70/image029.gif\" class\u003d\"text-top\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"45\" height\u003d\"23\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_8_1_realnumbersandthepythagoreantheorem_4_70/image030.gif\" alt\u003d\"*\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19566\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/approx.gif\"\u003e 6.0431\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
