      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSelect the two endpoints of the hypotenuse using the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19587\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19587\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e key.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the length as approximately 6.4031, verifying our earlier result.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-11 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_8_1_realnumbersandthepythagoreantheorem_4_70/f-70-4-5.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
